  "body": "Would you please make it so, after the page has access to the device, it can query the serial number? I would like to store user customizations based on serial number, and there is presently no way to do this.\r\n\r\nRight now I am using WebUSB (where serial number is available), but WebHID would allow me to support our legacy products as well, so I would like to support it.",
